  "\"If they've converted Gryps 2",
  " into a laser emitter,",
  " there must be a lot of rock...\"",
  "\"Gryps 2 is moving from the Gate",
  " of Zedan to a position",
  " where it can snipe the moon.\"",
  "\"The junk they dumped",
  " drifts off on its own.\"",
  "\"But did they really convert",
  " a whole colony",
  " into a laser?\"",
  "\"Finding that out",
  " is this operation's purpose.\"",
  "Gryps 2",
  "was a closed-type colony.",
  "As had been done",
  "with the Mahal colony before,",
  "converting it into a colony laser",
  "was far from impossible.",
  "If it were completed,",
  "it would be a tool to hold",
  "every space dweller in check,",
  "more so than the intercontinental",
  "ballistic missiles of the old era.",
  "Anywhere in the Earth Sphere,",
  "it could turn a lunar city or a",
