  "That the AEUG",
  "should fear this",
  "was only natural.",
  "\"So we're scouting",
  " the forces at Gryps 1,",
  " the Gate of Zedan, too?\"",
  "\"...What's that?\"",
  "\"!?\"",
  "Fa",
  "\"You can't be here, Rosamie!\"",
  "\"I told you, the study room!\"",
  "\"I'm sorry!\"",
  "\"Don't scold Fa...",
  " It's my fault...",
  " I'm not used to it here...\"",
  "\"Come on! Let's go,",
  " Rosamie.\"",
  "\"So that's the civilian",
  " we took on at Bunch 13?\"",
  "\"Captain, I'd like Dr. Hasan",
