  " examination.\"",
  "\"Is that all right, Kamille?\"",
  "\"Y-yes...!\"",
  "\"...If Lieutenant Quattro",
  " says so...\"",
  "\"Are you saying Rosamie",
  " is a Cyber-Newtype?\"",
  "\"No! ...I never",
  " said any such thing,",
  " Kamille.\"",
  "\"Y-you didn't?\"",
  "\"...That's right, Kamille.\"",
  "But the tension aboard the ship",
  "was beginning to awaken",
  "the psychological conditioning,",
  "the imprinting,",
  "of Rosamie, or rather",
  "of the woman",
