  " Please!\"",
  "\"Huh? What is it?\"",
  "\"Hey, about Kamille,",
  " about you, anything at all,",
  " just talk to me...!\"",
  "\"Sure, but what's wrong,",
  " Rosamie...?\"",
  "\"I-I'm scared to be alone.",
  " That's all it is...\"",
  "Scirocco's Embrace",
  "The Horror of Colony Drops",
  "Scirocco",
  "\"You came to me",
  " because you wanted",
  " peace for your soul, didn't you?\"",
  "Reccoa",
  "\"Peace for my soul...?\"",
  "\"Even though",
  " your heart was wounded,\"",
