  " lacked the sensitivity",
  " to notice it...\"",
  "\"......\"",
  "\"So you had no choice",
  " but to play the strong woman.\"",
  "\"But you grew exhausted.",
  " You wanted a place",
  " to heal that weariness.\"",
  "\"You talk as though",
  " you'd seen it all yourself.\"",
  "\"Ah...?\"",
  "Scirocco gently",
  "embraced Reccoa.",
  "It was something",
  "she had never once",
  "been given on the Argama.",
  "\"There's no need to act tough.\"",
  "\"...!\"",
  "\"I understand you.\"",
  "\"...Then may I...",
  " believe you...?\"",
  "\"Ah...\"",
  "\"This warmth is",
