  "\"I'm returning to the Jupitris",
  " in the Palace Athene.",
  " I'll leave the Messala with you.\"",
  "\"What!?\"",
  "\"Use it as you see fit.\"",
  "\"Thank you very much.\"",
  "\"Don't trust Colonel Bask.",
  " I'll call you back in time.\"",
  "It was from around this time",
  "that Scirocco began",
  "to show open rivalry",
  "toward Bask.",
  "Bask's militarism, his appetite",
  "for killing civilians,",
  "was shunned alike by the veteran",
  "officers and men who believed",
  "the Titans an elite, and by",
  "the newcomers who had poured in",
  "from the Federation Forces.",
  "Soldiers loathe",
  "pointless slaughter above all.",
  "Their imagination tells them",
  "that it would escalate the war,",
  "and that their own families",
  "and lovers would meet",
  "the same fate.",
  "The mentality of the space age",
  "had made it the norm,",
  "in order to endure",
  "the harsh environment of space,",
  "to wage war by certain rules,",
  "and the mobile suit,",
  "a tool that brought out individual",
  "valor to the fullest,",
  "only accelerated that.",
  "Indeed, even when the hatred",
