  "would bring society crashing down,",
  "until in the end",
  "they might never even meet",
  "the partner they would",
  "spend their lives with.",
  "And so,",
  "the aversion to Bask,",
  "a man unwilling",
  "to dirty his own hands,",
  "was shared by Jerid, by Reccoa,",
  "and by Yazan alike.",
  "Reading that sentiment,",
  "Scirocco steadily",
  "extended his power.",
  "By this era, space colonies",
  "had already fallen",
  "to Earth twice.",
  "Once in Operation British,",
  "and once more",
  "in Operation Stardust.",
  "Both times, the Earth",
  "Federation Forces failed",
  "to destroy the colony cylinder",
  "and let the colony",
  "fall to Earth.",
  "Operation British was not",
  "merely a matter",
  "of Sydney exploding.",
  "It was destruction beyond the",
  "imagination of later generations.",
  "After all, the fore section",
  "that fell on Sydney alone stood",
  "over 30,000 meters tall.",
  "That is three times",
  "the world's highest peak,",
  "Chomolungma.",
  "Even \"a small island falling",
  "from the sky\" hardly covers it.",
  "Its kinetic energy",
  "set off crustal upheaval;",
  "mountain-building surged",
  "in the Americas",
  "and Australia,",
  "and the land was transformed.",
  "Even the shock wave",
  "from the colony",
  "merely passing by",
  "raised a planet-wide tsunami",
  "and violent storms.",
  "The colony drops did not",
  "merely destroy Earth's",
  "environment; they wrecked",
  "its economic base as well.",
  "Delaz's drop was especially",
  "grave: North America, the largest",
  "grain-growing region after",
  "the One Year War, became",
  "a wasteland, and Earth's food",
  "self-sufficiency plunged.",
  "Earth found itself held",
  "by the scruff of the neck",
  "by the agricultural colonies.",
  "Worse, the AEUG and other groups",
  "against the Earth Federation",
  "destroyed most of the",
  "microwave satellites that beamed",
