  "who had survived the colony drops",
  "were left with deep scars.",
  "Four Murasame",
  "and Rosamia Badam",
  "were among them.",
  "And mad scientists,",
  "thinking such trauma might",
  "trigger the emergence of a",
  "Newtype, went so far as",
  "to make these girls",
  "their guinea pigs.",
  "Bask",
  "\"A mobile suit, you say?\"",
  "Operator",
  "\"Launching the MS team!\"",
  "\"Right.\"",
