  " no saving us at all.\"",
  "\"This matter",
  " stays between us.",
  " You know why, don't you?\"",
  "\"...That's how adults do it!",
  " It's underhanded.",
  " What good is hiding it!?\"",
  "\"I knew it!",
  " I just have to play the adult!",
  " Pretend I understand!\"",
  "Meanwhile...",
  "\"I hear you made contact",
  " with the Argama's mobile suit,",
