  "\"Yes...\"",
  "\"I'm going down to the deck.\"",
  "\"Sir?\"",
  "\"Don't you think it's too quiet?\"",
  "\"Yeah. This space is so dirty",
  " they don't even need",
  " to float decoys...\"",
  "\"Which means Reccoa's",
  " information is true.",
  " Most likely...\"",
  "\"Right...",
  " If the colony laser is real,",
