  "\"Side 2, Bunch 18.",
  " One mirror half destroyed.\"",
  "\"A direct hit.",
  " It should have punched at least",
  " two holes about 200 meters wide.\"",
  "\"Will the colony hold?\"",
  "\"It should hold, but...\"",
  "\"What the hell have they done!?",
  " ...Those bastards!\"",
  "\"Call off the mobile suit launch!",
  " This ship is leaving the area",
