  "through every space dweller.",
  "Soldier",
  "\"Congratulations,",
  " Colonel Bask.\"",
  "\"So, at 100% output,",
  " this would...\"",
  "\"Exactly!\"",
  "\"With this, the neutral colonies",
  " and the moon crowd alike\"",
