  " to defy our Titans.\"",
  "\"The Argama is withdrawing.\"",
  "\"Heh! Hahahahahahaha!\"",
  "\"B...",
  " But there's no going back now...",
  " Ahh...\"",
  "This attack",
  "sent a shudder through the AEUG.",
